Super simple to operate, ready to use out of the box — zero learning curve for beginners, no need to develop your own strategies or do complicated debugging.
1. After installing and logging in, the software comes with four major trading coins built in, plus the official standard teaching model, and all four core features are enabled by default;
2. No need to tweak complex parameters — just go into the software's Settings section and fine-tune three basic parameters: position size per trade, max concurrent positions overall, and K-line timeframe (15min / 1H / 4H);
3. Save your settings, hit start, and it runs fully automatically. The system handles market scanning, value assessment, trade selection, error correction, trend take-profit, and range-bound dormancy all by itself — no need to watch the charts or intervene manually.
